                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> Five-year GBM Monte Carlo simulation with 1,000 paths per scenario. Historical daily volatility is scaled by 1.0× (Base), 1.5× (High Volatility), and 2.0× (Stress), while daily log-return drift, initial price, forecast horizon, and random seed remain constant.</run>
